{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2022-06-13 09:00:00', 'title': 'CISCO AND EMTRAIN ANNOUNCE PARTNERSHIP TO BUILD A CONSCIOUS WORKPLACE CULTURE FOR HYBRID WORK', 'text': "PROJECT FOCUSES ON DELIVERING IN-APP TRAINING TO CREATE INCLUSIVE WORKPLACES ON WEBEX SAN FRANCISCO , JUNE 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EMTRAIN , A COMPANY PROVIDING ELEARNING AND ANALYTICS TO CREATE INCLUSIVE WORKPLACES BY DEVELOPING PRO-SOCIAL SKILLS, AND CISCO ARE ANNOUNCING A PARTNERSHIP TO INTEGRATE EMTRAIN'S TRAINING MODULES THROUGH WEBEX'S COLLABORATION SOLUTIONS. THIS IS ONE OF THE FIRST PROJECTS OF A BROADER PARTNERSHIP WITH CISCO TO SUPPORT WORKPLACE CULTURE IN A CHANGING HYBRID WORKPLACE."}